ransparent.\nWall design: The wall combines dark walnut wood veneer and light gray latex paint wall, with a large full-wall mirror, reflecting the dining area, staff, doors and windows, etc., enhancing the sense of spatial extension; the wall is equipped with retro Manchurian window style lattice, small decorative paintings, creating a retro market atmosphere, the style is retro Hong Kong-style/Republic of China style (not new Chinese style).\nFloor design: The floor is transitioned with black and white retro four-leaf flower pattern tiles (local area) + wood grain tiles, and warm light floor lamps are hidden in the tile area to enhance the space atmosphere.\nDetail requirements: Completely restore the original image's spatial structure, materials, lighting, perspective, wood grain is only used as an embellishment, bright and sufficient light, real restaurant space, rich details, real texture, no exaggerated design.", "2k", "3:4", false, 633371508294270, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "api_config", "label": "api_config", "type": "RH_OPENAPI_CONFIG", "localized_name": "api_config"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "resolution"}, "name": "resolution", "label": "resolution", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "resolution"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspectRatio"}, "shape": 7, "name": "aspectRatio", "label": "aspectRatio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspectRatio"}, {"widget": {"name": "skip_error"}, "shape": 7, "name": "skip_error", "label": "skip_error", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "skip_error"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "shape": 7, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "type": "RH_RhartImageNProTextToImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [690.4756469726562, 431.6736145019531], "pos": [213.6856689453125, 655.976318359375], "id": 2, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Nod